// Server-only — never shipped to the client bundle. If this vocabulary were
// part of @smoosh/protocol it would ship in every player's JS, letting anyone
// inspect it and recognize the real prompt during GUESS.
//
// Prompts are generated by combining slots, and every slot word maps to
// something players can actually find in the asset library (animals, parts,
// props, backgrounds — see public/assets/manifest.json). The combinations
// are random on purpose: the absurdity is the game. When the library gains
// new tags, add them to the matching slot here.

